        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/extras/9260164f3a93a9068cee1e2317bd0cb1.avif?t=1761835450\" width=616 height=107 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Halloween was supposed to be simple.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Halloween is off to a rough start. The plan was simple: get ready, grab your friend, and hit the party. But when the mayor turns up dead in a back alley, &quot;simple&quot; is officially off the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Sunny Summers. She's got a moody attitude, a wardrobe that's 99% black, and zero interest in being a hero — or anything positive really. She takes out her mood swings on her AI companion Cogs, a lovable penguin robot. They are, without a doubt, the worst duo to ever be tasked with solving a murder. But sometimes, you don't get to choose your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A modern take on the classic Point-and-Click genre.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Investigate a conspiracy bigger than one dead body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve challenging logic puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Endure nonsensical humor and snappy dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stuff, craft stuff, shoot stuff (in that order)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the evil (and mostly your own inner demons)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PSA: Sunny and Cogs are unstoppable!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/extras/813eda4b33e5b0dda83a3d7d06798976.poster.avif?t=1761835450\" width=154 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/extras/813eda4b33e5b0dda83a3d7d06798976.webm?t=1761835450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/extras/813eda4b33e5b0dda83a3d7d06798976.mp4?t=1761835450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
